  "content": {
    "id": "p27-q23-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "23",
    "prompt": "Solve $7^{1-x}=6\\times5^{x-3}$. Give your answer to 3 decimal places.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=\\dfrac{\\log_{10}7+3\\log_{10}5-\\log_{10}6}{\\log_{10}7+\\log_{10}5}\\approx1.401$\n\nTake common logarithms, apply the power law, then collect the terms containing the unknown.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{10}7^{1-x}&=\\log_{10}(6\\times5^{x-3})\\\\(1-x)\\log_{10}7&=\\log_{10}6+(x-3)\\log_{10}5\\\\\\log_{10}7-x\\log_{10}7&=\\log_{10}6+x\\log_{10}5-3\\log_{10}5\\\\x\\log_{10}7+x\\log_{10}5&=\\log_{10}7+3\\log_{10}5-\\log_{10}6\\\\x(\\log_{10}7+\\log_{10}5)&=\\log_{10}7+3\\log_{10}5-\\log_{10}6\\\\x&=\\frac{\\log_{10}7+3\\log_{10}5-\\log_{10}6}{\\log_{10}7+\\log_{10}5}\\\\x&\\approx1.401\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 25
  },
